[-]- **AI backend home & streaming** - **single JWT-verified Intelligence Service** owns all model + embedding calls; **cost-principle reversed** → **Google Gemini free tier** via `google-genai`, behind a provider abstraction (local Ollama fallback): guide=`gemini-3.5-flash-lite`, generation+grading=`gemini-3.6-flash`, embeddings=`gemini-embedding-001`@768-dim `task_type`. **Streaming** = `POST`+`fetch` ReadableStream over `/v1/*` (**not** EventSource - header auth), provider-neutral SSE frames; guide streams deltas + **reveal = separate gated call**, generation streams per-question, grading req/resp. **Prompt arch** = git-versioned Jinja templates (ported open-notebook), SSTI variable rule, untrusted-as-data, native `responseSchema`. **Abuse hardening** = key in `services/intelligence/.env` server-side; **no endpoint runs the model on arbitrary text - every call bound to a user-owned artifact**; durable Postgres rate-limits + free-tier circuit breaker; audit logging. #14/#13 seam: #14 owns the embedding client, #13 bulk-drives it. ([#14](https://github.com/rings0fsaturn/study-planner-web/issues/14))[/-]
[-]- **Data + service architecture refactor (spine)** - **async mechanism = pgmq / Supabase Queues** (Kafka rejected: no Kafka-shaped load; fan-out tiny; replay already owned by `public.events`; job state now *inside* the source-of-truth DB). **Two Python services**: **Ingestion Service** (worker-only: deterministic parsers → extract `full_text` → chunk) + **Intelligence Service** (API + worker: embed via Gemini per #14, LLM topics). #13 chunk/embed splits along the #14 seam. **pgmq multi-stage queues** `ingest.extract→embed→topics` (Postgres-trigger enqueue; visibility-timeout retry); one-image/two-entrypoints (web+worker). **Spine = Tine C / no bus to the frontend**: write path stays local-first & untouched (Dexie→`sync_queue`→`public.events`); migration `004` = server-owned content tables (`full_text`/chunks/`content_embeddings` pgvector) as Postgres SoT; pointer-events-only on the log/snapshot; Dexie = redacted cache. **Audit gaps fixed**: `sync_checkpoints` migration added (RLS `auth.uid()`); 5 MB snapshot cap = **enforce** client-side (skip+telemetry, full-replay fallback). ([#22](https://github.com/rings0fsaturn/study-planner-web/issues/22))[/-]
[-]- **Content ingestion & storage** - material model = **A/unify + first-class server-owned library** (add materials in a store, attach to roadmaps; grain locked **1 material = 1 ingested body**; multi-source = N materials in one assessment → N clean KT signals). **Fork 2a**: material is a **server-first entity** (Postgres `materials` = SoT, direct supabase-js CRUD, RLS; **not** event-sourced), only a thin roadmap-attach pointer `{materialId,title,role,estimatedDuration}` rides the log (roadmap-engine untouched); `materialId` DB-minted; onboarding material-add becomes online-requiring. **Creation trigger-driven** (client INSERT + Storage upload → Postgres trigger → pgmq; workers service-role; no bespoke endpoint). **Migration `004`** = `materials` (nullable `source_type` → contentless allowed) + `content_chunks` with **folded `halfvec(768)`** HNSW cosine; RLS `auth.uid()=user_id`. **`material-raw`** bucket (private, `<uid>/<materialId>/<file>`, 25 MB, pdf/docx/pptx/txt/md; keep raw after extract). **Status = 5a** single `materials.status` state machine (`pending→extracting→chunking→embedding→ready`+`failed`; pgmq transport-only; read via Realtime; partial ingest keeps `full_text` displayable, RAG gates on `ready`). **Recovery** = retry (re-enqueue stage) / delete+re-add (cascade + client Storage remove) / replace-keep-id. Free tier: ~900–1000+ avg materials with halfvec; ⚠️ project pauses after 7 days idle. ([#12](https://github.com/rings0fsaturn/study-planner-web/issues/12))[/-]
[-]- **Vector store, embeddings & async jobs** - embedding+retrieval design on the #12/#22 base. **Chunking** 400-token/60-overlap, structure-then-recursive, tiktoken, `start_seconds` col for YT citations. **Preprocess** (Ingestion, zero-quota): deterministic cleaning + local-ML transcript punctuation; YT transcript = `youtube-transcript-api` in the Python worker (metadata edge fn stays, can't fetch captions); contextual-aug/semantic-chunk rejected on quota→eval note. **Embeddings** `gemini-embedding-001`@768 **L2-normalized before store** (Gemini doesn't self-normalize <3072; beyond open-notebook), keep cosine; batch 100/per-batch-commit; **resume=idempotent NULL-scan**; **backpressure=auto pgmq-redelivery** on 429 (manual Retry only for real failures); **reserve RPM headroom for the query hot path**; `status_detail` via Realtime. **Retrieval** server-internal only; RPC `match_content_chunks(...)` under user JWT (RLS) + mandatory `material_id` scoping; top-k 10 + loose floor; **local `bge-reranker` on gen+grading, off for guide**; generation=full_text-in-context-when-it-fits (policy→#18). **Lifecycle** replace=drop+rebuild / retry=resume; HNSW 16/64/`ef_search=100`, single index + **`hnsw.iterative_scan` (pgvector ≥0.8)** for filtered recall. **Eval hook** retrieval logging + levers-as-config; gold-set recall@k/MRR+rerank-ablation named as future deliverable. Migration `005` pins vector≥0.8; RPC in `006`. ([#13](https://github.com/rings0fsaturn/study-planner-web/issues/13))[/-]
[-]- **Grounded assessment-generation pipeline** - end-to-end generation on the #12/#13/#14/#15 base (**keystone**). **Topology** = two-stage **plan→generate** (ported open-notebook `ask` plan→fan-out shape, synthesis barrier dropped; stage-2 authoring = transformation-execution pattern + native `responseSchema`). **Grounding** = two-tier: **full_text-in-context when it fits** (~60-70% budget, sized from chunk `token_count`) else **topic-stratified coverage-sampling + MMR** (net-new beyond open-notebook); similarity-retrieval reserved for *targeted* "about topic X" slots; blueprint routes grounding per slot. **Adaptive difficulty** (#18↔#19 seam) = blueprint reads per-skill `p∈[0,1]` from a **client-supplied mastery snapshot** in the request (no server mastery store; #19 owns computing `p`); **ZPD "aim just above"** + calibration-spread cold-start + blended weak/coverage selection. **Composition** = user recipe `{count,family-mix}`, blueprint fills format/difficulty/topic; **groundedness-over-count** (fewer + `Warning[]`, never pad); coding gated on code-bearing material. **Typed gen** = per-format `responseSchema` (envelope + visible payload + **server-only hidden block**: objective answers / written rubric+reference / coding reference-solution+full test set); **Judge0 self-check** at gen (coding solution must pass its own tests). **Validation** = structural + **citation-id grounding verification** (cited `content_chunks.id` in-scope) + coding self-check; **online groundedness = citation-id only** (LLM faithfulness judge → offline #23); **one repair → else drop** + dedup; circuit-breaker + attempt cap. **Granularity** = **per-slot fan-out** (bounded concurrency), one Question per SSE frame. **Storage** (`007_assessments.sql`, co-owned #15) = `assessments` (row up-front `status='generating'` = LLM-artifact + resume anchor; `material_ids[]`,`recipe`,`blueprint`,`warnings`,`grounding_stale`) + `questions` (per-question `material_id` = clean KT signal; `hidden_block`,`citations`); **answer-key secrecy = column-level `REVOKE SELECT (hidden_block) FROM authenticated`** (service-role reads for grading); thin `AssessmentCreated` pointer; redacted `assessmentContentCache` = envelope+visible_payload; `grounding_stale` flag (#18 owns, #10 owns UX). **Eval** = cheap telemetry now; 3 offline metrics → tracked ticket **#23** (blocked-by #18+#20, written triggers). ([#18](https://github.com/rings0fsaturn/study-planner-web/issues/18))[/-]
